1
00:00:01,293 --> 00:00:02,837
OH, HEY,
YOU GUYS, LOOK.

2
00:00:02,878 --> 00:00:05,631
UGLY NAKED GUY'S
PUTTING STUFF IN BOXES.

3
00:00:07,633 --> 00:00:09,802
HUH... I'D SAY
FROM THE LOOKS OF IT

4
00:00:09,844 --> 00:00:11,679
OUR NAKED BUDDY
IS MOVING.

5
00:00:11,720 --> 00:00:15,724
IRONICALLY, MOST OF THE BOXES
SEEM TO BE LABELED "CLOTHES."

6
00:00:15,766 --> 00:00:19,436
AAH, I'M GOING TO MISS
THAT BIG, OLD, SQUISHY BUTT.

7
00:00:19,478 --> 00:00:22,857
AND WE'RE DONE
WITH THE CHICKEN FRIED RICE.

8
00:00:22,898 --> 00:00:23,858
HEY!

9
00:00:23,899 --> 00:00:25,192
HEY, IF HE'S MOVING

10
00:00:25,233 --> 00:00:27,235
MAYBE I SHOULD TRY
TO GET HIS PLACE.

11
00:00:27,277 --> 00:00:28,654
OH, GOOD IDEA.
YES.

12
00:00:28,696 --> 00:00:31,031
IT'LL BE SO COOL
TO LIVE ACROSS
FROM YOU GUYS.

13
00:00:31,072 --> 00:00:34,075
YEAH, HEY, THEN
WE COULD DO THAT
TELEPHONE THING--

14
00:00:34,117 --> 00:00:35,744
YOU KNOW, WELL,
YOU HAVE A CAN

15
00:00:35,786 --> 00:00:37,078
WE HAVE A CAN

16
00:00:37,120 --> 00:00:39,080
AND IT'S CONNECTED
BY A STRING.

17
00:00:39,122 --> 00:00:42,626
OR WE COULD DO THE
ACTUAL TELEPHONE THING.

18
00:00:49,008 --> 00:00:54,262
♪ SO NO ONE TOLD YOU
LIFE WAS GONNA BE THIS WAY ♪

19
00:00:54,304 --> 00:00:56,640
♪ YOUR JOB'S A JOKE,
YOU'RE BROKE ♪

20
00:00:56,682 --> 00:00:59,601
♪ YOUR LOVE LIFE'S D.O.A. ♪

21
00:00:59,643 --> 00:01:03,981
♪ IT'S LIKE YOU'RE ALWAYS
STUCK IN SECOND GEAR ♪

22
00:01:04,023 --> 00:01:06,942
♪ WHEN IT HASN'T BEEN YOUR DAY,
YOUR WEEK, YOUR MONTH ♪

23
00:01:06,984 --> 00:01:08,986
♪ OR EVEN YOUR YEAR ♪

24
00:01:09,028 --> 00:01:12,614
♪ BUT I'LL BE THERE FOR YOU ♪

25
00:01:12,656 --> 00:01:14,742
♪ WHEN THE RAIN STARTS TO POUR ♪

26
00:01:14,783 --> 00:01:17,327
♪ I'LL BE THERE FOR YOU ♪

27
00:01:17,369 --> 00:01:19,580
♪ LIKE I'VE BEEN THERE BEFORE ♪

28
00:01:19,621 --> 00:01:22,791
♪ I'LL BE THERE FOR YOU ♪

29
00:01:22,833 --> 00:01:28,672
♪ 'CAUSE YOU'RE THERE
FOR ME, TOO. ♪

30
00:01:31,759 --> 00:01:34,261
OH, MY GOD,
I LOVE THIS APARTMENT.

31
00:01:34,302 --> 00:01:35,637
ISN'T IT PERFECT?

32
00:01:35,679 --> 00:01:37,598
I CAN'T BELIEVE
I NEVER REALIZED

33
00:01:37,639 --> 00:01:38,933
HOW-HOW GREAT IT IS.

34
00:01:38,974 --> 00:01:40,517
WELL, THAT IS BECAUSE

35
00:01:40,559 --> 00:01:43,144
YOUR EYE IMMEDIATELY GOES
TO THE BIG NAKED MAN.

36
00:01:43,186 --> 00:01:44,312
Phoebe:
IT'S AMAZING.

37
00:01:44,354 --> 00:01:46,065
YOU'D BETTER HURRY UP

38
00:01:46,105 --> 00:01:48,943
AND FILL OUT AN APPLICATION,
OR I'M GOING TO BEAT YOU TO IT.

39
00:01:48,984 --> 00:01:50,110
( giggling ):
OH.

40
00:01:53,530 --> 00:01:55,198
WELL, I NEVER THOUGHT
I'D SAY THIS

41
00:01:55,240 --> 00:01:57,701
BUT I'M GOING TO GO USE
UGLY NAKED GUY'S BATHROOM.

42
00:01:57,743 --> 00:01:59,078
YEAH.

43
00:02:02,247 --> 00:02:04,458
OH, LOOK,
THERE'S MONICA AND CHANDLER.

44
00:02:04,499 --> 00:02:05,876
HEY!

45
00:02:05,918 --> 00:02:07,795
HEY, YOU GUYS! HEY!

46
00:02:11,339 --> 00:02:13,717
AAH!

47
00:02:13,759 --> 00:02:16,219
AAH! AAH!

48
00:02:16,261 --> 00:02:17,220
WHAT?

49
00:02:17,262 --> 00:02:19,222
AAH! CHANDLER
AND MONICA!

50
00:02:19,264 --> 00:02:20,891
CHANDLER AND MONICA!

51
00:02:20,933 --> 00:02:22,559
OH, MY GOD!
AAH!

52
00:02:22,601 --> 00:02:23,894
CHANDLER AND MONICA!

53
00:02:23,936 --> 00:02:25,228
OH, MY GOD!
OH!

54
00:02:25,270 --> 00:02:26,688
OH, MY EYES!

55
00:02:26,730 --> 00:02:27,689
MY EYES!

56
00:02:27,731 --> 00:02:28,690
OH, PHOEBE!

57
00:02:28,732 --> 00:02:29,691
PHOEBE...
OW!

58
00:02:29,733 --> 00:02:30,692
OKAY! IT'S OKAY!

59
00:02:30,734 --> 00:02:31,693
IT'S OKAY!

60
00:02:31,735 --> 00:02:33,236
NO, THEY'RE DOING IT!

61
00:02:33,278 --> 00:02:34,237
I KNOW! I KNOW!

62
00:02:34,279 --> 00:02:35,238
YOU KNOW?!

63
00:02:35,280 --> 00:02:36,740
YES, I KNOW
AND JOEY KNOWS!

64
00:02:36,782 --> 00:02:37,908
BUT ROSS
DOESN'T KNOW!

65
00:02:37,950 --> 00:02:39,534
SO YOU HAVE TO
STOP SCREAMING!

66
00:02:39,576 --> 00:02:41,120
HEY, WHAT'S GOING ON?

67
00:02:41,161 --> 00:02:42,121
OH!
OH!

68
00:02:42,162 --> 00:02:43,998
( yelling )

69
00:02:44,039 --> 00:02:45,248
WHAT? WHAT?

70
00:02:45,290 --> 00:02:47,042
NOTHING. OH, GOD,
WE'RE JUST SO EXCITED

71
00:02:47,084 --> 00:02:48,794
THAT YOU MIGHT
GET THIS APARTMENT!

72
00:02:48,836 --> 00:02:50,420
YEAH, IT LOOKS
REALLY GOOD...

73
00:02:50,462 --> 00:02:52,673
OH, MY GOD!

74
00:02:52,714 --> 00:02:54,842
GET IN HERE!

75
00:02:54,883 --> 00:02:56,217
COME ON!

76
00:02:56,259 --> 00:02:59,262
( all yelling )

77
00:03:02,641 --> 00:03:04,768
YOU MEAN, WHENEVER
MONICA AND CHANDLER

78
00:03:04,810 --> 00:03:06,812
WERE, LIKE, YOU KNOW,
"DOING LAUNDRY"

79
00:03:06,854 --> 00:03:08,605
OR GOING "GROCERY SHOPPING..."

80
00:03:08,647 --> 00:03:10,524
ALL THAT TIME MONICA
SPENT ON THE PHONE

81
00:03:10,565 --> 00:03:11,942
WITH "SAD LINDA FROM CAMP"?

82
00:03:11,984 --> 00:03:13,234
DOING IT. DOING IT.

83
00:03:13,276 --> 00:03:14,235
PHONE DOING IT.

84
00:03:14,277 --> 00:03:15,445
OH!

85
00:03:15,487 --> 00:03:16,738
OH, I CAN'T BELIEVE IT.

86
00:03:16,780 --> 00:03:18,573
I MEAN, I THINK IT'S GREAT...

87
00:03:18,615 --> 00:03:19,908
FOR HIM.

88
00:03:19,950 --> 00:03:21,702
SHE MIGHT BE ABLE
TO DO BETTER.

89
00:03:23,162 --> 00:03:24,121
HEY, YOU GUYS.

90
00:03:24,163 --> 00:03:25,122
JOEY, COME HERE!

91
00:03:25,164 --> 00:03:26,289
PHOEBE JUST
FOUND OUT

92
00:03:26,331 --> 00:03:28,792
ABOUT MONICA AND CHANDLER.

93
00:03:28,834 --> 00:03:31,586
YOU MEAN, HOW
THEY'RE FRIENDS
AND NOTHING MORE?

94
00:03:31,628 --> 00:03:32,921
NO.

95
00:03:32,963 --> 00:03:34,255
NO. JOEY, SHE KNOWS.

96
00:03:34,297 --> 00:03:36,299
WE WERE AT UGLY
NAKED GUY'S APARTMENT

97
00:03:36,341 --> 00:03:38,719
AND WE SAW THEM DOING IT
THROUGH THE WINDOW.

98
00:03:38,760 --> 00:03:40,387
ACTUALLY, WE SAW THEM

99
00:03:40,428 --> 00:03:42,848
DOING IT UP AGAINST THE WINDOW.

100
00:03:42,890 --> 00:03:44,349
OKAY, SO NOW,
THEY KNOW

101
00:03:44,391 --> 00:03:47,102
YOU KNOW AND THEY DON'T KNOW
THAT RACHEL KNOWS?

102
00:03:47,144 --> 00:03:49,104
YES, BUT...
YOU KNOW WHAT?

103
00:03:49,146 --> 00:03:51,190
IT DOESN'T MATTER
WHO KNOWS WHAT.

104
00:03:51,231 --> 00:03:52,482
NOW ENOUGH OF US KNOW

105
00:03:52,524 --> 00:03:54,651
THAT WE COULD JUST
TELL THEM WE KNOW.

106
00:03:54,693 --> 00:03:56,611
NOW ALL THE LYING
AND THE SECRETS

107
00:03:56,653 --> 00:03:58,030
WILL FINALLY BE OVER.

108
00:03:58,072 --> 00:03:59,907
OR WE COULD
NOT TELL THEM WE KNOW

109
00:03:59,948 --> 00:04:01,867
AND HAVE A LITTLE FUN
OF OUR OWN.

110
00:04:03,911 --> 00:04:05,412
WH-WHAT DO YOU MEAN?

111
00:04:05,453 --> 00:04:07,831
EVERY TIME THAT THEY SAY
THEY'RE DOING LAUNDRY

112
00:04:07,873 --> 00:04:09,208
WE'LL GIVE THEM A BUNCH

113
00:04:09,249 --> 00:04:10,542
OF LAUNDRY TO DO.

114
00:04:10,584 --> 00:04:12,211
OH... I-I WOULD ENJOY THAT.

115
00:04:12,251 --> 00:04:13,420
NO, WAIT. WAIT.

116
00:04:13,461 --> 00:04:15,547
YOU KNOW WHAT WOULD
BE EVEN MORE FUN?

117
00:04:15,589 --> 00:04:16,924
TELLING THEM.

118
00:04:16,965 --> 00:04:19,718
YEAH, NO.
I WANT TO DO PHOEBE'S THING.

119
00:04:19,760 --> 00:04:21,220
NO, BUT I CAN'T...

120
00:04:21,260 --> 00:04:22,846
YOU DON'T HAVE
TO DO ANYTHING.

121
00:04:22,888 --> 00:04:24,681
JUST DON'T TELL THEM
THAT WE KNOW.

122
00:04:24,723 --> 00:04:26,683
NO. I CAN'T TAKE
ANY MORE SECRETS.

123
00:04:26,725 --> 00:04:29,019
I GOT YOUR SECRETS.
I GOT THEIR SECRETS.

124
00:04:29,061 --> 00:04:31,563
I GOT SECRETS OF
MY OWN, YOU KNOW?

125
00:04:31,605 --> 00:04:33,732
YOU DON'T HAVE ANY SECRETS.

126
00:04:33,774 --> 00:04:34,900
OH, YEAH?

127
00:04:34,942 --> 00:04:37,027
WELL, YOU DON'T
KNOW ABOUT HUGGSY--

128
00:04:37,069 --> 00:04:38,570
MY BEDTIME PENGUIN PAL.

129
00:04:41,573 --> 00:04:42,908
SO... UM....

130
00:04:42,950 --> 00:04:45,911
HOW-HOW ARE WE GOING
TO MESS WITH THEM?

131
00:04:45,953 --> 00:04:47,621
( moaning )

132
00:04:47,662 --> 00:04:49,539
WELL, YOU COULD
USE YOUR POSITION

133
00:04:49,581 --> 00:04:52,375
YOU KNOW, AS THE ROOMMATE,
AND THEN I WOULD USE

134
00:04:52,417 --> 00:04:55,045
YOU KNOW, THE STRONGEST TOOL
AT MY DISPOSAL--

135
00:04:55,087 --> 00:04:57,047
MY SEXUALITY.

136
00:04:57,089 --> 00:04:58,548
HELLO, CHILDREN.

137
00:04:58,590 --> 00:05:00,008
HEY.
HEY.
HEY.

138
00:05:00,050 --> 00:05:02,469
OKAY, WATCH... LEARN...
AND DON'T EAT MY COOKIE.

139
00:05:05,264 --> 00:05:06,223
HEY.

140
00:05:06,265 --> 00:05:07,515
HEY.

141
00:05:07,557 --> 00:05:09,684
OOH, WOW, THAT JACKET
LOOKS GREAT ON YOU.

142
00:05:09,726 --> 00:05:10,811
REALLY?

143
00:05:10,852 --> 00:05:12,729
YEAH. THE MATERIAL
LOOKS SO SOFT...

144
00:05:12,771 --> 00:05:14,731
OH, HELLO, MR. BICEP.

145
00:05:16,775 --> 00:05:18,359
HAVE YOU BEEN
WORKING OUT?

146
00:05:18,401 --> 00:05:21,696
WELL, I TRY TO
YOU KNOW, SQUEEZE THINGS.

147
00:05:21,738 --> 00:05:25,909
( giggling )

148
00:05:25,951 --> 00:05:27,661
ARE YOU OKAY?

149
00:05:27,702 --> 00:05:30,580
WELL, IF YOU REALLY
WANT TO KNOW...

150
00:05:30,622 --> 00:05:32,582
I, OH, I CAN'T
TELL YOU THIS.

151
00:05:32,624 --> 00:05:35,252
PHOEBE, IT'S ME--
YOU CAN TELL ME ANYTHING.

152
00:05:35,294 --> 00:05:37,254
ACTUALLY, YOU'RE
THE ONE PERSON

153
00:05:37,296 --> 00:05:38,922
I CAN'T TELL THIS TO

154
00:05:38,964 --> 00:05:41,466
AND THE ONE PERSON
I WANT TO THE MOST.

155
00:05:43,302 --> 00:05:45,386
WHAT'S GOING ON?

156
00:05:45,428 --> 00:05:48,598
I THINK IT'S JUST
THAT I HAVEN'T BEEN
WITH A GUY IN SO LONG

157
00:05:48,640 --> 00:05:51,601
AND YOU KNOW HOW
SOMETIMES YOU'RE
LOOKING FOR SOMETHING

158
00:05:51,643 --> 00:05:54,313
AND YOU JUST DON'T
EVEN SEE THAT'S
IT RIGHT THERE

159
00:05:54,353 --> 00:05:56,606
IN FRONT OF YOU
SIPPING COFFEE...

160
00:05:56,648 --> 00:06:00,194
OH, NO, HAVE I
SAID TOO MUCH?

161
00:06:00,235 --> 00:06:03,530
WELL, JUST SOMETHING
TO THINK ABOUT...

162
00:06:03,571 --> 00:06:04,823
I KNOW I WILL.

163
00:06:06,491 --> 00:06:08,327
OOH...

164
00:06:17,752 --> 00:06:19,546
YOU ARE SO CUTE.

165
00:06:19,587 --> 00:06:21,548
HOW DID YOU GET
TO BE SO CUTE?

166
00:06:21,589 --> 00:06:22,674
WELL

167
00:06:22,716 --> 00:06:24,551
MY GRANDFATHER WAS SWEDISH...

168
00:06:24,592 --> 00:06:26,636
AND MY GRANDMOTHER
WAS, ACTUALLY

169
00:06:26,678 --> 00:06:28,013
A TINY, LITTLE BUNNY.

170
00:06:28,055 --> 00:06:31,599
NOW YOU'RE
EVEN CUTER.

171
00:06:32,934 --> 00:06:35,229
YOU KNOW, THAT IS
A POPULAR OPINION TODAY

172
00:06:35,270 --> 00:06:36,230
I MUST SAY.

173
00:06:36,271 --> 00:06:37,647
WHAT?

174
00:06:37,689 --> 00:06:40,192
THE WEIRDEST THING HAPPENED
AT THE COFFEE HOUSE.

175
00:06:40,234 --> 00:06:42,110
I THINK PHOEBE
WAS HITTING ON ME.

176
00:06:42,152 --> 00:06:45,072
WHAT ARE YOU
TALKING ABOUT?

177
00:06:45,113 --> 00:06:47,324
I'M TELLING YOU,
I THINK PHOEBE

178
00:06:47,366 --> 00:06:49,910
THINKS I'M FOXY.

179
00:06:49,951 --> 00:06:52,120
IT'S NOT POSSIBLE.

180
00:06:52,162 --> 00:06:53,788
OW.

181
00:06:55,707 --> 00:06:57,667
I'M SORRY.
IT'S JUST...

182
00:06:57,709 --> 00:06:59,836
I MEAN, PHOEBE HAS
JUST ALWAYS THOUGHT

183
00:06:59,878 --> 00:07:02,339
YOU WERE CHARMING IN
A SEXLESS KIND OF WAY.

184
00:07:02,381 --> 00:07:05,008
OH, WELL, YOU KNOW,
I-I CAN'T HEAR THAT ENOUGH.

185
00:07:05,050 --> 00:07:06,260
I-I'M SORRY.

186
00:07:06,301 --> 00:07:08,970
I JUST THINK THAT
YOU MISUNDERSTOOD HER.

187
00:07:09,012 --> 00:07:10,805
NO. I DIDN'T
MISUNDERSTAND, OKAY?

188
00:07:10,847 --> 00:07:12,099
SHE WAS ALL OVER ME.

189
00:07:12,140 --> 00:07:14,309
SHE TOUCHED MY BICEP,
FOR CRYING OUT LOUD.

190
00:07:14,351 --> 00:07:16,061
THIS BICEP?

191
00:07:16,103 --> 00:07:18,897
WELL, IT'S NOT
FLEXED RIGHT NOW.

192
00:07:24,027 --> 00:07:25,862
HEY, MON, WHAT
ARE YOU DOING NOW?

193
00:07:25,904 --> 00:07:27,948
YOU WANT TO COME
SEE A MOVIE WITH US?

194
00:07:27,989 --> 00:07:29,574
UH... YOU KNOW,
ACTUALLY

195
00:07:29,616 --> 00:07:31,952
I-I WAS GOING
TO DO SOME LAUNDRY.

196
00:07:33,370 --> 00:07:34,495
HEY, CHANDLER

197
00:07:34,537 --> 00:07:36,039
YOU WANT TO DO
IT WITH ME?

198
00:07:36,081 --> 00:07:38,250
SURE, I'LL...
DO IT WITH YOU.
OKAY.

199
00:07:39,584 --> 00:07:41,920
OKAY, GREAT. HOLD ON A SEC.

200
00:07:43,422 --> 00:07:45,715
OH... HERE YOU GO.

201
00:07:45,757 --> 00:07:47,717
YOU DON'T MIND, DO YOU?

202
00:07:47,759 --> 00:07:50,304
THAT WOULD REALLY HELP ME
OUT A LOT. THANKS.

203
00:07:50,345 --> 00:07:51,554
YOU KNOW WHAT?

204
00:07:51,596 --> 00:07:54,099
I-I DON'T THINK
I HAVE ENOUGH QUARTERS.

205
00:07:54,141 --> 00:07:55,600
OH, I HAVE QUARTERS.

206
00:07:55,642 --> 00:07:56,643
OH!

207
00:07:58,770 --> 00:07:59,896
HEY.

208
00:07:59,938 --> 00:08:01,106
HEY, ROSS

209
00:08:01,148 --> 00:08:02,732
ANY WORD
ON THE APARTMENT YET?

210
00:08:02,774 --> 00:08:04,192
I CALLED OVER THERE

211
00:08:04,234 --> 00:08:06,403
AND UGLY NAKED GUY
IS SUBLETTING IT HIMSELF

212
00:08:06,445 --> 00:08:08,571
AND HE'S ALREADY HAD
LIKE 100 APPLICANTS.

213
00:08:08,613 --> 00:08:09,572
OH.
OH, MAN.

214
00:08:09,614 --> 00:08:10,907
I'VE GOT THE EDGE.

215
00:08:10,949 --> 00:08:12,700
I KNOW IT'S NOT EXACTLY ETHICAL

216
00:08:12,742 --> 00:08:14,411
BUT I SENT HIM A LITTLE BRIBE

217
00:08:14,453 --> 00:08:16,330
TO TIP THE SCALES
IN MY DIRECTION.

218
00:08:16,371 --> 00:08:18,415
YEAH. CHECK IT OUT.
YOU CAN PROBABLY

219
00:08:18,457 --> 00:08:20,208
SEE IT FROM THE WINDOW.

220
00:08:20,250 --> 00:08:22,461
OH, IS IT THAT
PINBALL MACHINE

221
00:08:22,501 --> 00:08:24,212
WITH THE BIG
BOW ON IT?

222
00:08:24,254 --> 00:08:26,214
NO.

223
00:08:26,256 --> 00:08:28,216
THAT NEW MOUNTAIN BIKE?

224
00:08:28,258 --> 00:08:30,218
NO.

225
00:08:30,260 --> 00:08:33,221
WELL, WHAT
DID YOU SEND?

226
00:08:33,263 --> 00:08:36,224
A BASKET OF MINI MUFFINS.

227
00:08:36,266 --> 00:08:39,769
BUT THERE'S A WHOLE TABLE
OF MINI MUFFIN BASKETS

228
00:08:39,811 --> 00:08:41,562
WHICH ONE DID YOU SEND?

229
00:08:41,604 --> 00:08:43,898
THE SMALL ONE.

230
00:08:43,940 --> 00:08:46,276
WHAT? YOU-YOU ACTUALLY
THOUGHT THAT BASKET

231
00:08:46,318 --> 00:08:48,236
WAS GOING TO GET YOU
THE APARTMENT?

232
00:08:48,278 --> 00:08:49,446
WELL... YEAH.

233
00:08:49,488 --> 00:08:51,572
SOMEONE SENT US
A BASKET AT WORK ONCE

234
00:08:51,614 --> 00:08:54,368
AND PEOPLE WENT CRAZY
OVER THOSE LITTLE MUFFINS.

235
00:08:54,409 --> 00:08:56,244
IT WAS THE BEST DAY.

236
00:08:56,286 --> 00:08:58,705
YOUR WORK MAKES ME SAD.

237
00:08:58,746 --> 00:09:00,081
( sighing )

238
00:09:00,123 --> 00:09:02,917
OH, MAN...
I WANT THAT PLACE SO MUCH...

239
00:09:02,959 --> 00:09:06,171
AND I WAS SO SURE
THAT WAS GOING TO WORK.

240
00:09:06,213 --> 00:09:09,924
THERE'S 12 BUCKS
I'LL NEVER SEE AGAIN.

241
00:09:09,966 --> 00:09:11,134
ALL RIGHT,
WE'D BETTER GO

242
00:09:11,176 --> 00:09:12,844
IF WE'RE GOING
TO CATCH THAT MOVIE.

