480
00:20:20,260 --> 00:20:22,429
OKAY, OKAY, OKAY, OKAY!

481
00:20:22,471 --> 00:20:23,514
FINE! YOU WIN!

482
00:20:23,556 --> 00:20:24,515
I CAN'T HAVE

483
00:20:24,557 --> 00:20:25,599
