484
00:20:25,641 --> 00:20:26,600
AND WHY NOT?

485
00:20:26,642 --> 00:20:27,894
BECAUSE I'M IN LOVE WITH MONICA.

486
00:20:27,935 --> 00:20:29,436
YOU-YOU'RE WHAT?

487
00:20:31,313 --> 00:20:32,523
Chandler:
LOVE HER!

488
00:20:32,565 --> 00:20:34,608
THAT'S RIGHT! I LOVE HER!

489
00:20:34,650 --> 00:20:37,195
I LOVE HER!

490
00:20:41,615 --> 00:20:44,451
I LOVE YOU, MONICA.

491
00:20:44,493 --> 00:20:46,495
I LOVE YOU,
TOO, CHANDLER.

492
00:20:51,000 --> 00:20:53,544
I JUST... I THOUGHT
YOU GUYS WERE DOING IT.

493
00:20:53,586 --> 00:20:55,421
I DIDN'T KNOW
YOU WERE IN LOVE.

494
00:20:57,673 --> 00:20:59,967
DUDE!

495
00:21:00,009 --> 00:21:02,095
AND HATS OFF
TO PHOEBE.

496
00:21:02,136 --> 00:21:03,971
QUITE A COMPETITOR.

497
00:21:04,013 --> 00:21:05,723
THANK YOU. THANK YOU.

498
00:21:05,765 --> 00:21:08,142
AND MAY I SAY
YOUR BREASTS ARE
STILL SHOWING?

499
00:21:08,184 --> 00:21:09,602
GOD.

500
00:21:09,643 --> 00:21:11,311
ALL RIGHT.

501
00:21:11,353 --> 00:21:12,312
SO, THAT'S IT.

502
00:21:12,354 --> 00:21:13,313
IT'S OVER.

503
00:21:13,355 --> 00:21:14,356
EVERYBODY KNOWS.

504
00:21:14,398 --> 00:21:15,900
WELL, ACTUALLY,
ROSS DOESN'T.

505
00:21:15,942 --> 00:21:18,819
YES, AND WE'D APPRECIATE IT
IF NO ONE TOLD HIM YET.

506
00:21:27,620 --> 00:21:28,955
A NEW PLACE
FOR A NEW ROSS.

507
00:21:28,996 --> 00:21:31,916
I'LL HAVE YOU AND ALL
THE GUYS FROM WORK OVER

508
00:21:31,958 --> 00:21:33,626
ONCE IT'S, YOU
KNOW, FURNISHED.

509
00:21:33,667 --> 00:21:36,003
I MUST SAY, IT'S NICE TO SEE YOU
BACK ON YOUR FEET.

510
00:21:36,045 --> 00:21:37,630
WELL, I AM THAT.

511
00:21:37,671 --> 00:21:40,216
AND THAT WHOLE RAGE THING
IS DEFINITELY BEHIND ME.

512
00:21:40,258 --> 00:21:41,801
I WONDER IF IT'S TIME FOR YOU

513
00:21:41,842 --> 00:21:43,594
TO REJOIN OUR TEAM
AT THE MUSEUM.

514
00:21:43,636 --> 00:21:46,013
OH, DONALD,
THAT WOULD BE GREAT.

515
00:21:46,055 --> 00:21:49,142
I AM TOTALLY READY
TO COME BACK TO WORK.

516
00:21:49,183 --> 00:21:50,684
I... WHAT?

517
00:21:50,726 --> 00:21:52,519
NO.

518
00:21:52,561 --> 00:21:54,981
WHA...

519
00:21:55,022 --> 00:21:57,275
WHAT ARE YOU DOING?!

520
00:21:57,316 --> 00:22:00,319
GET OFF MY SISTER!

521
00:22:00,360 --> 00:22:03,322
[Captioned by
The Caption Center
WGBH Educational Foundation]

